  "body": "Property Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/E7U2\r\n\r\nThere's something special about coming home to sunshine, peaceful valley views and a space to truly relax. Elevated to capture natural light and a lovely outlook, this inviting three-bedroom home offers warmth, comfort and space for the whole family to enjoy life's simple pleasures.\r\n\r\nFreshly painted throughout and complemented by brand-new carpet, the home is beautifully refreshed and ready to welcome its next owners. The separate lounge creates a cosy haven for family gatherings or quiet evenings, flowing through to a sun-soaked balcony, the perfect spot for your morning coffee, a good book or simply soak up the sunshine while admiring the valley views.\r\n\r\nThe spacious kitchen and dining area brings everyone together, whether it's a quick breakfast before school or a relaxed family dinner. Three comfortable bedrooms, a well-appointed family bathroom with both a bathtub and separate shower, plus a separate toilet, provide practical comfort for the whole household.\r\n\r\nStep outside and discover a generous lawn. Imagine children playing freely, pets enjoying the open space, summer BBQs with friends or simply unwinding in the sunshine. There's room here for laughter, connection and all the little moments that make a house feel like home.\r\n\r\nEveryday convenience adds to the appeal. Within walking distance of Pinehill School and Rangitoto College, and zoned for both Murrays Bay Intermediate and Northcross Intermediate, families will appreciate the excellent education options. A nearby bus stop makes commuting easy, while Browns Bay Beach and its vibrant village of cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, shops and motorway access are just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nThe owner is retiring, and the instruction is clear - THIS HOME MUST BE SOLD! If you've been searching for a home don't let this opportunity pass you by. Call us today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\n*Conjunctions from all Agents welcome*",
